# Keep most of tests/ ignored (runtime artefacts, downloaded fixtures,
# brim outputs, etc.). Specific tracked files are re-included via the
# negations near the bottom of this file (after the broad *.pcap /
# *.pcapng patterns, otherwise they cannot win).
tests/*
!tests/e2e/
!tests/e2e/**
# Both halves are required: tests/* excludes the directory itself, and git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded. The *.pcap /
# *.pcapng rules below still win over these, so captures dropped in here stay
# ignored while the Go sources do not.
!tests/integration/
!tests/integration/**
.idea
types/python
types/java
types/swift
types/rust
types/cpp
types/csharp
types/js
data/
__pycache__
pcaps
.vscode
*.log
*.pcap
*/*.pcap
*/*.pcapng
*.ncap*
# Re-include specific tracked test fixtures and Go test sources under
# tests/. Must come after the broad *.pcap / *.pcapng / tests/* rules
# above, otherwise the negations are ignored.
!tests/new_decoders_test.go
!tests/The Ultimate PCAP v20260316.pcapng
zeus/.history
zeus/dumps
priv.key
pub.key
dist/
!cmd/capture/webui/frontend/dist/
cmd/capture/webui/frontend/dist/*
!cmd/capture/webui/frontend/dist/MODULE_PLACEHOLDER.txt
vulnDBs
FlameGraph
# Generated docker build contexts (zeus copies vendored deps in here).
# NOTE: do not ignore a bare "Dockerfile" -- that pattern matches at any
# depth and untracked every docker/*/Dockerfile, including the one that
# builds the public netcap-service image.
.docker-build-context/
bin/
cover.out
coverage.html
deploy.sh
node_modules/
tmp/
# The `net` binary, at the repo root only. NOTE: must stay anchored with a
# leading slash -- a bare "net" matches at any depth and silently untracks
# cmd/net/, the directory holding the binary's main package.
/net

evals/

# Test outputs
test-output/
links.txt

# IDE
.cursor/

# Log files at any level
**/*.log

